      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience & scope\nTarget audience: first-time, never-licensed applicants seeking a regular passenger-car driving privilege in Utah, studying in English.\nKnowledge level: plain handbook English for readers with no prior license background; no driving jargon assumed.\nPrerequisites: none beyond ability to read English; Section 4 identity, residency and license-type basics are the starting point.\nDelivery scope: what knowledge to include and at what depth and vocabulary; teaching format is out of scope.\n",
